{"4120520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hex-Caliber", "steam_appid": 4120520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/3c45e6344b58ccb78fcffc26f04a2023.poster.avif?t=1782224904\" width=1170 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/3c45e6344b58ccb78fcffc26f04a2023.webm?t=1782224904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hex Calibre</strong> is where you stop waving wands like a silly twig-armed magician and start firing your Spells with a Gun like a PROPER wizard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve through area after area of fantasy monsters, as you feed them lead and compacted mana in this <strong>Dark Fantasy FPS Roguelite</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/7f145a6f06ab97ddabc1df6a6db92236.poster.avif?t=1782224904\" width=1170 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/7f145a6f06ab97ddabc1df6a6db92236.webm?t=1782224904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine slowly weaving magic into flames and lightning with you fingers. Slow and cliche, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, cast your Spell into the gun, and literally unleash fireballs and poison bombs out of your gun barrel. Spells scale off your gun and match it's nature. <strong>Pump out a wall of arcane arrows with a Shotgun, or blast apart monsters with wind bombs from your Assault rifle.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/95af1fcdfadfcaa6f48d3301b99a6e1d.poster.avif?t=1782224904\" width=1170 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/95af1fcdfadfcaa6f48d3301b99a6e1d.webm?t=1782224904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mana doesn't grow on trees. Obviously, they grow from shooting people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mana regeneration grows with your hit rate. The more accurate you are, the more mana you're awarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot. Generate. Cast. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/dffc63b49edbefdfe79ce9892f0f265a.poster.avif?t=1782224904\" width=1170 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/dffc63b49edbefdfe79ce9892f0f265a.webm?t=1782224904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, your library of Spells and available guns will slowly increases. In-run and meta progression systems make sure you're not limited to hurling boring fireballs with the same pistol every single run. Unless that's what you're into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All in all, Hex Calibre is an indie game project. Have fun blasting the dumb imps apart with the biggest magic missle you can combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare your Spells. Pick out your Sigils. Calibrate your Hexes.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/3c45e6344b58ccb78fcffc26f04a2023.poster.avif?t=1782224904\" width=1170 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/3c45e6344b58ccb78fcffc26f04a2023.webm?t=1782224904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hex Calibre</strong> is where you stop waving wands like a silly twig-armed magician and start firing your Spells with a Gun like a PROPER wizard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve through area after area of fantasy monsters, as you feed them lead and compacted mana in this <strong>Dark Fantasy FPS Roguelite</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/7f145a6f06ab97ddabc1df6a6db92236.poster.avif?t=1782224904\" width=1170 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/7f145a6f06ab97ddabc1df6a6db92236.webm?t=1782224904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine slowly weaving magic into flames and lightning with you fingers. Slow and cliche, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, cast your Spell into the gun, and literally unleash fireballs and poison bombs out of your gun barrel. Spells scale off your gun and match it's nature. <strong>Pump out a wall of arcane arrows with a Shotgun, or blast apart monsters with wind bombs from your Assault rifle.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/95af1fcdfadfcaa6f48d3301b99a6e1d.poster.avif?t=1782224904\" width=1170 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/95af1fcdfadfcaa6f48d3301b99a6e1d.webm?t=1782224904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mana doesn't grow on trees. Obviously, they grow from shooting people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mana regeneration grows with your hit rate. The more accurate you are, the more mana you're awarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot. Generate. Cast. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/dffc63b49edbefdfe79ce9892f0f265a.poster.avif?t=1782224904\" width=1170 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/extras/dffc63b49edbefdfe79ce9892f0f265a.webm?t=1782224904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, your library of Spells and available guns will slowly increases. In-run and meta progression systems make sure you're not limited to hurling boring fireballs with the same pistol every single run. Unless that's what you're into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All in all, Hex Calibre is an indie game project. Have fun blasting the dumb imps apart with the biggest magic missle you can combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare your Spells. Pick out your Sigils. Calibrate your Hexes.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Dive into the depths of Hell's Vestibule as a gunned Ritualist. Fight off roaming scores of monsters by empowering your firearms with spells and Rituals in a fast-paced dungeon crawler roguelike.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/a65e9ac1f894355092eccbbc720db8d14b35b964/header.jpg?t=1782224904", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/5718cd23ecd7eaa9824cc20b87f21a969b89781c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782224904", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120520/5718cd23ecd7eaa9824cc20b87f21a969b89781c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782224904", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 4600H / Intel Core i5-10400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 Ti / RX 560 (4 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 11 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 5600H / Intel Core i5-11400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1650 / Radeon 780M (4 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><